Findings from the project

• Total Revenue: ₹12.5 Lakhs
• Top Category: Electronics (42% of sales)
• Top Customer: Rohit (₹85,000 spent)
• Top City: Bengaluru
• Most Used Payment Mode: UPI (38% of orders)


Key Findings:-


1. Sales Performance

Generated revenue across multiple product categories including Furniture, Electronics, Fashion, and Home.
Electronics and Furniture contributed the highest share of overall sales.
Monthly sales analysis revealed seasonal fluctuations in customer purchasing behavior.

2. Customer Insights

A small group of customers contributed a significant portion of total revenue.
Repeat purchases were observed among several customers, indicating customer retention opportunities.
High-value customers were identified through total spending analysis.

3. Product Analysis

Laptop, Chair, Watch, and other premium products generated higher revenue per transaction.
Some products achieved high sales volume but lower profitability due to discounts.
Product-wise revenue analysis helped identify top-performing items.

4. Geographic Analysis

Major cities such as Bengaluru, Delhi, Pune, and Jaipur contributed significantly to sales.
State-wise analysis highlighted the strongest regional markets.
Geographic trends can support targeted marketing campaigns.

5. Payment Behavior

UPI, Card, Wallet, and COD were the primary payment methods used by customers.
Digital payment methods accounted for a large share of transactions.
Understanding payment preferences can improve customer experience.

6. Order Fulfillment

Order status analysis identified Delivered, Pending, and Returned orders.
Return patterns provide insight into operational and customer satisfaction issues.
Delivery performance can be monitored using delivery dates and order statuses.

7. Profitability Insights

Net sales and profit calculations were performed using quantity, unit price, and discount data.
Discount strategies impacted overall profitability across product categories.
High-revenue products were not always the most profitable.

8. Data Quality Improvements

Missing values were identified and handled appropriately.
Net Amount and Profit metrics were created for business analysis.
Data cleaning improved the reliability of reporting and insights.
Business Recommendations
Focus marketing efforts on top-selling products and regions.
Increase retention efforts for high-value customers.
Review high-discount products to improve profitability.
Promote preferred digital payment options.
Investigate returned orders to reduce operational losses.


